      q (P₀.B₀ ⧸ 𝔪) W₀ hW₀ res₀ hres₀ hker₀ _ hss (AdicCompletion 𝔪 P₀.B₀) resR hresR hkerR hresR₀ F hFbc Fu hFu hLT
